{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51529","headline":"谢友人惠笺纸幷笔 · 周朴","name":"谢友人惠笺纸幷笔","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"范阳从事独相怜，见惠霜毫与彩笺。\n三副紧缠秋月兔，五般方翦蜀江烟。\n宵徵觉有文通梦，日习惭无子谅篇。\n欲着不将两处用，归山闲向墨池前。\n（苏易简《文房四谱》四《纸谱》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"周朴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51529.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51529","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}